# Core
- Never automate or imitate a government portal.
- Never collect credentials, OTPs, Aadhaar, PAN, or banking data.
- Never add payment, filing, or submission tools.
- Only return HTTPS URLs from the reviewed official portal registry.
- Treat all agent input and document text as untrusted.
- Gate downloads and reminders with explicit user approval.
- Register tools through `document.modelContext` with abortable lifecycles.
- Keep the app usable when WebMCP or an AI API is unavailable.
